[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあ、綺麗……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow, it's beautiful..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これがミミの自由研究の成果ね。\n説明をお願いできるかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is the outcome of Mimi's independent research project. Mimi, would you like to talk us through your creation?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "祭事で花火をあげることもあると思いますが、\n近頃は騒音問題に発展することも多いと聞きました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fireworks are often set off during festivals, but I've heard they frequently lead to noise complaints."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……それで音のない花火を作ったってわけかあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... So you invented silent fireworks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいじゃんいいじゃん！\u3000もっとたくさん作ろう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's awesome! We need to make a bunch more of these!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ライザリン・シュタウト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Reisalin Stout."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "田舎から上京してきて、錬金術で日常を変える\n何かを成し遂げたいとランターナ学園に入学",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A country girl who came to the capital and enrolled at Lantarna Academy, hoping to change everyday life through alchemy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "支えるべき後輩ができて、以前よりも一歩\n成長したようだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now with younger students to mentor, she seems to have stepped up to the plate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、やっぱりちょっと寂しい感じはするよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But it feels like a crucial element is missing without the sound, don't you think?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしはやっぱり音があるほうが好きかな。\nドーンって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think I still prefer fireworks with noise. You know, BOOM!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ソフィー・ノイエンミュラー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie Neuenmuller."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "祖母が営んでいた寄る辺のない者たちの集まり\n「日影の会」を受け継ぎ、訪れた者の幸せを願っている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She inherited the Sunshine Society from her grandmother, a gathering place for wayward souls, and wishes happiness for all who visit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とても面倒見がよく、祖母直伝の特訓で\n後輩の才能を開花させたみたいだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With her caring nature, she's helped junior alchemists blossom through her grandmother's special training methods."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ次は、わたしが作ったものの発表だね。\n作ったのは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next up is my presentation! What I've made is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃーん！\u3000生きてるパイ！\n",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ta-daaa! A living pie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って、わああ！\u3000どこ行くのー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, waaah! Where are you going?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロライナ・フリクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorolina Frixell."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術科クラスのクラス委員長を務める。\n真面目だけど、少々おっちょこちょい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The class representative of the Alchemy Department. Diligent, but somewhat scatterbrained."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、彼女はすでに一人の後輩の心を救ったようだね。\n素晴らしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yet it seems she has already helped a junior student find acceptance. Marvelous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは。ロロナ先輩は相変わらずだなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha! Miss Rorona hasn't changed a bit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら？\u3000おっちょこちょいはあなたも負けず劣らずだと\n思うけど？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? I'd say you're just as scatterbrained as she is, wouldn't you agree?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えええっ！？\u3000そんなことない……よね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat?! That's not true... is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミミ・ウリエ・フォン・シュヴァルツラング",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi Houllier von Schwarzlang."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "名家の令嬢として生まれた彼女は、家柄で\n評価されることを嫌い自分の道を歩み続けてきた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Born into nobility, she dislikes being evaluated based on her family name and has always walked her own path."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "孤立しがちだった彼女も、この学園の仲間たちとなら\n新たな道を切り拓けるだろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though often isolated, with her companions at this academy, she'll surely forge a new path forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そして……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And then..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ・シュテルネンリヒト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna Sternenlicht."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術の才能が無いと言われ続けてきた彼女も、\nたくさんの仲間に支えられ、その才能を開花した",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Despite being told she had no talent for alchemy, with the support of many friends, her abilities have finally blossomed."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は信じているよ。\n君がもっともっと……遥かな高みに行くとね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I believe in you. That you will reach even greater heights..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やっとつかまえたー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Finally caught you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って、あれ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっと……不審者？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... who are you? You seem strange..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや！\u3000僕はただの生徒さ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, no! I'm just a student!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、ちゃんと見てくれ。怪しいところなんて\n一つもないだろう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Look, take a good look at me. There's nothing suspicious about me at all, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むううう？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmmmm???"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナー、どこ行ったの？\u3000教室に戻るって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona! Where did you go? We're heading back to the classroom!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、はーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm coming!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらが本校のグラウンドだ。\n集会もここで行われたりする。文化祭でも――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "These are the school grounds. Assemblies are held here too. During the cultural festival—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "帰ってきた、か。さて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, you've returned. Well then..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "君は変わったのかな？\u3000ふふ、楽しみだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Have you changed, I wonder? Hehe, I'm looking forward to finding out."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]